let t3 = run1("<crypt name=\"s\" op=\"sealpw\" password=\"pw\" value=\"hello\" iterations=\"50\"/><crypt name=\"o\" op=\"openpw\" password=\"pw\" value=\"$s.sealed\"/><crypt name=\"x\" op=\"openpw\" password=\"no\" value=\"$s.sealed\"/><return value=\"{o.plaintext}|{x.ok}\"/>");
feat("F142", "<crypt sealpw/openpw>", t3["value"] == "hello|false");
let t4 = run1("<crypt name=\"m\" op=\"keygen\"/><crypt name=\"e\" op=\"envelope\" key=\"$m.key\" value=\"big\"/><crypt name=\"d\" op=\"unenvelope\" key=\"$m.key\" value=\"$e.sealed\"/><return value=\"$d.plaintext\"/>");
feat("F143", "<crypt envelope/unenvelope>", t4["value"] == "big");
let t5 = run1("<crypt name=\"sh\" op=\"shamir\" secret=\"aabbccdd\" n=\"5\" k=\"3\"/><crypt name=\"c\" op=\"combine\" shares=\"$sh.shares\"/><return value=\"$c.secretHex\"/>");
feat("F144", "<crypt shamir/combine>", t5["value"] == "aabbccdd");
let t6 = run1("<crypt name=\"b\" op=\"b64\" value=\"héllo\"/><crypt name=\"d\" op=\"b64d\" value=\"$b.value\"/><crypt name=\"f\" op=\"b32\" value=\"foobar\"/><crypt name=\"mk\" op=\"merkle\" leaves=\"a,b,c\"/><crypt name=\"u\" op=\"uuid\"/><return value=\"{d.value}|{f.value}|{mk.count}|{u.ok}\"/>");
feat("F145", "<crypt b64/b32/merkle/uuid>", t6["value"] == "héllo|MZXW6YTBOI|3|true");
let t7 = run1("<crypt name=\"k\" op=\"keygen\"/><token name=\"t\" op=\"sign\" key=\"$k.key\" claim.sub=\"u1\" claim.role=\"admin\" now=\"1000\" ttl=\"60\" iss=\"me\"/><token name=\"v\" op=\"verify\" key=\"$k.key\" value=\"$t.token\" now=\"1010\" iss=\"me\"/><token name=\"x\" op=\"verify\" key=\"$k.key\" value=\"$t.token\" now=\"1100\"/><return value=\"{v.claims.sub}|{v.claims.role}|{x.reason}\"/>");
feat("F146", "<token sign/verify> (claim.* and ttl and iss)", t7["value"] == "u1|admin|expired");
let t8 = run1("<crypt name=\"k\" op=\"keygen\"/><token name=\"u\" op=\"signurl\" key=\"$k.key\" url=\"https://x.com/f?id=1\" now=\"100\" ttl=\"60\"/><token name=\"ok\" op=\"verifyurl\" key=\"$k.key\" url=\"$u.url\" now=\"120\"/><token name=\"late\" op=\"verifyurl\" key=\"$k.key\" url=\"$u.url\" now=\"200\"/><return value=\"{ok.ok}|{late.ok}\"/>");
feat("F147", "<token signurl/verifyurl>", t8["value"] == "true|false");
let t9 = run1("<otp name=\"s\" op=\"secret\"/><otp name=\"c\" op=\"code\" secret=\"$s.secret\" now=\"6000\"/><otp name=\"v\" op=\"verify\" secret=\"$s.secret\" code=\"$c.code\" now=\"6010\"/><otp name=\"u\" op=\"uri\" secret=\"$s.secret\" issuer=\"App\" account=\"a\"/><return value=\"{v.ok}|{u.ok}\"/>");
feat("F148", "<otp secret/code/verify/uri>", t9["value"] == "true|true");
let t10 = run1("<otp name=\"r\" op=\"recovery\" n=\"3\"/><otp name=\"c\" op=\"recoverycheck\" code=\"$r.codes.0\" hashes=\"$r.hashes\"/><return value=\"{c.ok}|{c.remaining.0}\"/>");
